                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2887280,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It's also known that in 1522, in the Turkish city of Constantinople, which was the centre of the Ottoman Empire, the court physician approved its use as a medicine.",
